{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, move to and grab it, check properties, perform task or scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = InspectObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />\"",
